# Native Bluetooth dialogs with a physical keyboard (task 014 P3c): APPLAUNCH_OSK=auto and one keyboard present, so
# the on-screen keyboard stays away and the dialogs show their buttons. Paired Devices: Forget confirmed (the car kit
# goes, "Forgot Car kit"); Scan: the tablet's passkey typed on the keyboard (Cancel / OK), too short ("Passkey must be
# 6 digits."), then complete; the Alias page with a service authorization request over it (No / Yes); Bluetooth
# switched off: the legacy notice on Paired Devices (OK goes back).
# Review only: no golden.
title settings native bluetooth dialogs
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1000
# Paired Devices (row 4): the car kit (row 2), Forget
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot bt_forget_buttons
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot bt_forgot
key ESC
wait 300
# Scan (row 5): the tablet (row 6 now that the car kit is gone)
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 2500
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
type 2468
shot bt_passkey
key ENTER
wait 300
shot bt_passkey_short
type 10
key ENTER
wait 3000
shot bt_passkey_paired
key ESC
wait 300
# Alias (row 1) with a service authorization request over it
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
btagent AuthorizeService 02:5A:00:00:00:01 0000110b-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb
shot bt_authorize
key ESC
wait 300
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
# Bluetooth off: the notice on Paired Devices
bt off
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot bt_power_off
key ENTER
wait 500
shot bt_power_off_back
